Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) on Iris Dataset

📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on performing Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) on the publicly available Iris dataset.

The project involves cleaning and exploring the dataset, performing basic statistical analysis, identifying patterns and correlations, and visualizing the data using different charts.

🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Jupyter Notebook
- Scikit-learn

🔍 Project Workflow

1. Load the Iris dataset
2. Explore the dataset structure
3. Check for missing values
4. Perform data cleaning
5. Calculate basic statistical measures
6. Analyze correlations between features
7. Visualize data distributions
8. Create charts and graphs
9. Identify important patterns and relationships

📊 Visualizations

The project includes:

- Histograms
- Correlation heatmap
- Pair plot
- Feature distribution analysis

